{
  "id": "314",
  "title": "I'm Going to Lose Weight",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-07-07",
  "synopsis": "Lucy wants to lose weight, but can she resist cake?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/463/dc91ebebac6b75afddbf32a8b4a52ed3cf821d72.mp3?1635865050",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 6: Maybe I Like Him",
    "chapter": 6,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我要减肥\n\n露西：我要减肥！\n小雨：你上个月也说你要减肥。\n露西：我后来忘了。这次不会忘了。我要从这个月开始减肥！\n小雨：好吧！我本来想请你吃蛋糕的，你要减肥，那就算了吧！\n露西：蛋糕？我要吃蛋糕！走吧！\n小雨：你不减肥了？\n露西：下个月再说吧！",
    "traditional": "我要減肥\n\n露西：我要減肥！\n小雨：你上個月也說你要減肥。\n露西：我後來忘了。這次不會忘了。我要從這個月開始減肥！\n小雨：好吧！我本來想請你吃蛋糕的，你要減肥，那就算了吧！\n露西：蛋糕？我要吃蛋糕！走吧！\n小雨：你不減肥了？\n露西：下個月再說吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I'm going to lose weight"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "露西：我要减肥！",
      "traditional": "露西：我要減肥！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ yào jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I’m going to lose weight!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：你上个月也说你要减肥。",
      "traditional": "小雨：你上個月也說你要減肥。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ shàng ge yuè yě shuō nǐ yào jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Last month you also said you were going to lose weight."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "露西：我后来忘了。这次不会忘了。我要从这个月开始减肥！",
      "traditional": "露西：我後來忘了。這次不會忘了。我要從這個月開始減肥！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ hòu lái wàng le zhè cì bú huì wàng le wǒ yào cóng zhè ge yuè kāi shǐ jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: But then I forgot it. This time I won’t forget it. I will lose weight starting this month!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：好吧！我本来想请你吃蛋糕的，你要减肥，那就算了吧！",
      "traditional": "小雨：好吧！我本來想請你吃蛋糕的，你要減肥，那就算了吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ hǎo ba wǒ běn lái xiǎng qǐng nǐ chī dàn gāo de nǐ yào jiǎn féi nà jiù suàn le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Alright! I wanted to treat you to cake, but since you’re on a diet let’s forget about it."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "露西：蛋糕？我要吃蛋糕！走吧！",
      "traditional": "露西：蛋糕？我要吃蛋糕！走吧！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī dàn gāo wǒ yào chī dàn gāo zǒu ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Cake? I want to eat cake! Let’s go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小雨：你不减肥了？",
      "traditional": "小雨：你不減肥了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ bù jiǎn féi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Aren’t you on a diet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "露西：下个月再说吧！",
      "traditional": "露西：下個月再說吧！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī xià ge yuè zài shuō ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Maybe next month!"
    }
  ],
